From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 19:41:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 27/54] Write workspace documentation so rustdoc reports no
 warnings

Bare URLs become autolinks, literal brackets and HTML-like placeholders are escaped or quoted as code, and
intra-doc links to items outside a crate's scope become code spans. The app-server, config and Python SDK
schemas copy these doc comments, so they are regenerated with upstream's generators.
